<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>💨 LIVE WIND</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Status:</b> LIVE / CURRENT MODEL (analysis, GLWU + HRRR + RRFS-NA, GDPS fallback)</p><p><b>Source:</b> NOAA/NCEP GLWU v2.1 surface U/V (Great Lakes water) + HRRR 3km 10m U/V + RRFS North American 10m U/V + ECCC GDPS fallback<br/><a href="https://nomads.ncep.noaa.gov/cgi-bin/filter_glwu.pl">https://nomads.ncep.noaa.gov/cgi-bin/filter_glwu.pl</a></p><p>Transparent outside valid water data so existing project layers (shipwrecks, lighthouses, harbors, parks) stay visible. Turn on/off independently of all other layers.</p><p><i>Not endorsed by NOAA.</i></p><p><b>Coverage</b> — one at a time, switched right here in this folder:<br>◉ <b>Global Coverage</b> (shown)<br>○ Continental Coverage<br>○ Great Lakes Basin Coverage<br>Pro switches exclusively. Web/app: check exactly one box.</p>]]></description>
    <Folder>
      <name>LIVE WIND — BEAUFORT SCALE</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Single continental field at NA resolution; same Beaufort colors, dual opacity, streamlet and label engines as the original basin layer, density-matched per degree.</p><p><b>Coverage:</b> Global Coverage<br><b>Precedence:</b> GLWU valid (Great Lakes water) > HRRR valid (its domain, GLWU not applicable) > RRFS-NA valid (elsewhere) > GDPS (verified gaps only) > transparent.<br><b>Provenance:</b> {'glwu 20261026/19': 'n=13895/g=4061', 'hrrr hrrr.20261026/23': 'n=701862/g=176900', 'rrfs-na rrfs.20261026/00': 'n=2632946/g=1195390', 'gdps': 'GDPS_15km_Wind_10m n=5273396/g=6479996'}</p><p><b>Coverage</b> — one at a time, switched right here in this folder:<br>◉ <b>Global Coverage</b> (shown)<br>○ Continental Coverage<br>○ Great Lakes Basin Coverage<br>Pro switches exclusively. Web/app: check exactly one box.</p>]]></description>
      <Style>
        <ListStyle>
          <listItemType>radioFolder</listItemType>
        </ListStyle>
      </Style>
      <GroundOverlay>
        <name>Global Coverage</name>
        <visibility>1</visibility>
        <drawOrder>10</drawOrder>
        <Icon>
          <href>https://wyattleathorn7.github.io/great-lakes-live-environment/wind_na/current.png?v=na-wind-20261027-0002-gdps-GDPS_15km_Wind_10m-n-5273396-g-6479996-glwu-20261026-19-n-13895-g-4061-hrrr-hrrr.20261026-23-n-701862-g-176900-rrfs-na-rrfs.20261026-00-n-2632946-g-1195390</href>
          <refreshMode>onInterval</refreshMode>
          <refreshInterval>900</refreshInterval>
        </Icon>
        <LatLonBox>
          <north>90.0</north>
          <south>-90.0</south>
          <east>180.0</east>
          <west>-180.0</west>
        </LatLonBox>
      </GroundOverlay>
